	)
	(text_box "The BILLEE Astronaut Module seeks to fulfill the requirement located in [Page 6] of the linked document.\nIts primary purpose is to connect the astronaut with a two way video and audio feed to the ground station via the Wifi Hotspot on the Rover's Nvidia Jetson Orin AGX. The ground station can then talk to the astronaut and view their feed via a web-browser.\nFor more information on how the software that drives this module works, go to BILLEE-hardware-2027/astronaut-streamer"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 181.61 25.4 0)
		(size 99.06 67.31)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rsKkkrWkLyB8JmJG5VgD8T7EQ4WewH5A/view")
		)
		(uuid "943aaaaa-3e45-4b27-a22b-57690e95652d")
	)
	(text_box "This system is also designed to be wearable. Within this repo, STL designs have been made to incorporate this system to a chest mount that the astronaut can wear."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 181.61 95.25 0)
		(size 99.06 18.2591)
